Description: expose the user-modifiable settings to the viewer
 The viewer enumerates the CID-to-Unicode collection table from a
 helper copied out of the pre-4 engine, where the user-modifiable
 settings block was reachable; the bundled 4.0 header places it after
 a private: label, so the viewer does not compile. Mark that block
 public, matching the pre-4 layout.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/BePDF

diff --git a/xpdf/xpdf/GlobalParams.h b/xpdf/xpdf/GlobalParams.h
index 3efef16..0e35881 100644
--- a/xpdf/xpdf/GlobalParams.h
+++ b/xpdf/xpdf/GlobalParams.h
@@ -426,6 +426,7 @@ private:
   NameToCharCode *		// mapping from char name to
     macRomanReverseMap;		//   MacRomanEncoding index
 
+public:
   //----- user-modifiable settings
 
   GString *baseDir;		// base directory - for plugins, etc.
